#: ../../errors.md:1
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "Àṣìṣe"

#: ../../errors.md:3
msgid ""
"When a request fails, the response body always has the same shape, "
"whatever went wrong."
msgstr ""
"Nígbà tí ìbéèrè kan bá kuna, ara ìdáhùn máa ń ní ìṣètò kan náà, "
"ohunkóhun tí ó bá fa ìṣòro náà."

#: ../../errors.md ../../errors.md:15
msgid "`type`"
msgstr "`type`"

#: ../../errors.md:16
msgid "A machine readable category. Branch your code on this value."
msgstr "Ẹ̀ka tí ẹ̀rọ lè kà. Lo iye yìí láti pín ìhùwàsí kóòdù rẹ."

#: ../../errors.md:18
msgid "`message`"
msgstr "`message`"

#: ../../errors.md:19
msgid ""
"A plain explanation for humans. Show it in logs, but do not parse it. The"
" wording can change."
msgstr ""
"Àlàyé tó rọrùn fún ènìyàn. Ṣàfihàn rẹ̀ nínú àwọn log, ṣùgbọ́n má ṣe "
"túpalẹ̀ rẹ̀. Ọ̀rọ̀ náà lè yí padà."

#: ../../errors.md:21
msgid "`request_id`"
msgstr "`request_id`"

#: ../../errors.md:22
msgid ""
"The ID of this request. It is also in the `X-Request-ID` response header."
" Quote it when you contact support, and never send your API key."
msgstr ""
"ID ìbéèrè yìí. Ó tún wà nínú àkọsílẹ̀ ìdáhùn `X-Request-ID`. Sọ ọ́ nígbà "
"tí o bá kan sí ẹ̀ka ìrànwọ́, kí o má sì ṣe fi API key rẹ ránṣẹ́ láé."

#: ../../errors.md:24
msgid "Error types"
msgstr "Àwọn irú àṣìṣe"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Ipò"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "What it means"
msgstr "Ohun tí ó túmọ̀ sí"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Retry?"
msgstr "Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kansi?"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`authentication_required`"
msgstr "`authentication_required`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "401"
msgstr "401"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The `Authorization` header is missing or malformed."
msgstr "Àkọsílẹ̀ `Authorization` kò sí tàbí ó ní ìṣètò tí kò tọ́."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "Rárá"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`invalid_api_key`"
msgstr "`invalid_api_key`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The key is not recognised."
msgstr "A kò mọ̀ key náà."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`invalid_request`"
msgstr "`invalid_request`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "400"
msgstr "400"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "A field is missing or has a bad value. The message names the field."
msgstr "Field kan kò sí tàbí ó ní iye tí kò tọ́. Ìfiranṣẹ́ náà ń tọ́ka sí field náà."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`unsupported_language`"
msgstr "`unsupported_language`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid ""
"The model does not support this language. The message lists the ones it "
"does."
msgstr ""
"Model kò ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún èdè yìí. Ìfiranṣẹ́ náà ń ṣàkójọ àwọn èdè tí ó "
"ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`unsupported_region`"
msgstr "`unsupported_region`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The region is not one of `ke`, `ug`, `ma` or `mu`."
msgstr "Ẹkùn náà kò sí lára `ke`, `ug`, `ma` tàbí `mu`."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`model_not_found`"
msgstr "`model_not_found`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "404"
msgstr "404"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "There is no model with that ID. List models with `GET /v1/models`."
msgstr "Kò sí model tí ó ní ID náà. Ṣàkójọ àwọn model pẹ̀lú `GET /v1/models`."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`not_found`"
msgstr "`not_found`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "There is no endpoint at that path."
msgstr "Kò sí endpoint ní ọ̀nà yẹn."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`method_not_allowed`"
msgstr "`method_not_allowed`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "405"
msgstr "405"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The endpoint does not accept that HTTP method."
msgstr "Endpoint náà kò gba HTTP method yẹn."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`rate_limit_exceeded`"
msgstr "`rate_limit_exceeded`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "429"
msgstr "429"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "You used all your requests for this minute."
msgstr "O ti lo gbogbo àwọn ìbéèrè rẹ fún ìṣẹ́jú yìí."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Yes, after `Retry-After`"
msgstr "Bẹ́ẹ̀ni, lẹ́yìn `Retry-After`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`internal_error`"
msgstr "`internal_error`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "500"
msgstr "500"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Something went wrong on the service side."
msgstr "Ohun kan kò lọ dáadáa ní ẹ̀gbẹ́ iṣẹ́ náà."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Yes, with backoff"
msgstr "Bẹ́ẹ̀ni, pẹ̀lú ìdádúró tó ń pọ̀ sí i"

#: ../../errors.md:39
msgid ""
"A `400`, `401`, `404` or `405` means the request itself needs to change. "
"Sending it again unchanged will fail again."
msgstr ""
"`400`, `401`, `404` tàbí `405` túmọ̀ sí pé ìbéèrè náà fúnra rẹ̀ nílò "
"àyípadà. Ríránṣẹ́ sí i lẹ́ẹ̀kansi láìyípadà yóò tún kuna."

#: ../../errors.md:41
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ"

#: ../../errors.md:43
msgid "A model that does not support the language you asked for:"
msgstr "Model tí kò ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún èdè tí o béèrè fún:"

#: ../../errors.md:55
msgid ""
"The fix is in the message. Use a model that supports the language, or "
"choose one of the listed languages."
msgstr ""
"Ìtúnṣe náà wà nínú ìfiranṣẹ́. Lo model tí ó ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún èdè náà, "
"tàbí yan ọ̀kan lára àwọn èdè tí a ṣe àkójọ."

#: ../../errors.md:57
msgid "Rate limits"
msgstr "Àwọn ààlà ìwọ̀n ìbéèrè"

#: ../../errors.md:59
msgid ""
"Each API key can make 10 requests per minute. The count resets at the "
"start of each minute. Every response tells you where you stand."
msgstr ""
"API key kọ̀ọ̀kan lè ṣe ìbéèrè mẹ́wàá fún ìṣẹ́jú kan. Ìkà náà máa ń bẹ̀rẹ̀ "
"padà ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ìṣẹ́jú kọ̀ọ̀kan. Gbogbo ìdáhùn máa ń sọ fún ọ bí ìlò rẹ ṣe rí."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Àkọsílẹ̀"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Ìtumọ̀"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Requests allowed per minute."
msgstr "Iye àwọn ìbéèrè tí a gbà láàárín ìṣẹ́jú kan."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Requests left in the current minute."
msgstr "Iye àwọn ìbéèrè tó kù nínú ìṣẹ́jú yìí."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Seconds until the count resets."
msgstr "Iṣẹ́jú-aaya mélòó kan ló kù kí ìkà náà bẹ̀rẹ̀ padà."

#: ../../errors.md:67
msgid ""
"When you use up your requests, the next one returns status `429` with a "
"`Retry-After` header."
msgstr ""
"Nígbà tí o bá ti lo gbogbo àwọn ìbéèrè rẹ, èyí tó tẹ̀lé máa dá ipò `429` "
"padà pẹ̀lú àkọsílẹ̀ `Retry-After`."

#: ../../errors.md:88
msgid ""
"Wait for the number of seconds in `Retry-After`, then send the request "
"again. Retrying straight away only uses up more of your allowance."
msgstr ""
"Dúró fún iye iṣẹ́jú-aaya tó wà nínú `Retry-After`, lẹ́yìn náà rán ìbéèrè "
"náà sí i lẹ́ẹ̀kansi. Gbìyànjú lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ máa ń jẹ́ kí o lo púpọ̀ sí i nínú "
"ààyè ìlò rẹ."

#: ../../errors.md:90
msgid ""
"If you see `429` often, slow your requests down. Watch `X-RateLimit-"
"Remaining` and pause before it reaches zero."
msgstr ""
"Tí o bá ń rí `429` lọ́pọ̀ ìgbà, dín ìgbà tí o fi ń rán àwọn ìbéèrè kù. "
"Máa wo `X-RateLimit-Remaining` kí o sì dá dúró kí ó tó dé odo."

#: ../../errors.md:92
msgid "What to retry"
msgstr "Ohun tí a lè gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kansi"

#: ../../errors.md:94
msgid ""
"Retry `429` after the `Retry-After` delay. Retry `500` and network "
"failures with exponential backoff, which means waiting a little longer "
"after each failed attempt. Never retry the other errors."
msgstr ""
"Gbìyànjú `429` lẹ́ẹ̀kansi lẹ́yìn ìdádúró `Retry-After`. Gbìyànjú `500` àti "
"àwọn àṣìṣe nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì lẹ́ẹ̀kansi pẹ̀lú ìdádúró tó ń pọ̀ sí i, èyí túmọ̀ sí "
"dídúró díẹ̀ síi lẹ́yìn gbogbo ìgbìyànjú tí ó kuna. Má ṣe gbìyànjú àwọn àṣìṣe "
"mìíràn lẹ́ẹ̀kansi."

#: ../../errors.md:96
msgid ""
"The [production checklist](production.md) includes a client that does all"
" of this."
msgstr ""
"[Production checklist](production.md) náà ní client kan tó ń ṣe gbogbo "
"ìwọ̀nyí nínú."